  "description": "A beautifully refurbished two-bedroom loft-style apartment with a spacious upper loft, two shower rooms, excellent storage and designated parking, within easy walking distance of Dún Laoghaire’s main shopping street.\n\n1. Location & Transport\n\nIdeally located approximately 650 metres from George’s Street Upper, Dún Laoghaire’s main shopping street,, the apartment is within easy walking distance of a wide range of shops, cafés, restaurants and everyday amenities.\n\nA bus stop is conveniently located just outside the development at the nearby junction, providing easy connections to Dún Laoghaire and surrounding areas. The apartment also comes with one designated parking space.\n\n2. The Apartment & Interior\n\nThe apartment has been extensively refurbished and thoughtfully furnished throughout, combining a distinctive loft-style layout with warm, characterful interiors and high-quality furnishings.\n\nAt the heart of the home is an impressive double-height living and dining area, featuring solid wood herringbone flooring and a striking spiral staircase. Hand-painted artwork, brass-framed mirrors and vintage-inspired lighting add warmth and character, while the large window provides plenty of natural light.\n\nThe lower level comprises a fully equipped kitchen, two separate double bedrooms, a shower room, and the main living and dining area. The refurbished kitchen includes a washer-dryer, dishwasher, oven and a large double-door fridge-freezer,as well as a range of other small appliances.\n\nBoth bedrooms feature full blackout curtains, fitted wardrobes and beds with built-in storage, providing excellent storage and sleeping comfort.\n\nThe spiral staircase leads to a spacious upper loft with its own private shower room. Furnished with a high-quality Chesterfield-style double storage bed, vintage armchair and coffee table, it provides a flexible space for sleeping, reading or relaxing. A ceiling-track blackout curtain allows the loft to be screened off when privacy is preferred.\n\n3. Neighbourhood & Surroundings\n\nThe apartment forms part of a small residential development of just six homes, with friendly neighbours and a quiet, welcoming atmosphere.\n\nA well-kept front lawn with a bench and additional green space to the rear provide pleasant shared outdoor areas. The communal grounds and exterior are regularly maintained by the property management company.\n\nDespite being within easy walking distance of the shops, cafés and restaurants of Dún Laoghaire, the development itself remains peaceful and relaxed, offering an appealing balance between town-centre convenience and quiet residential living.\n",
